  "contract": [
    "Enslave Elemental 954534 is normally trainable by Felsworn 14 at level 20. At level 47 an ordinary",
    "Dust Devil 832 can be controlled and released; all three level-46 Noxxion variants",
    "13282/113282/213282 must reject the same normal cast. Archived db.exil.es/npc/13282 explicitly lists",
    "Charm immunity; page SHA256 cd1659fe7c1a1d0dd193140861d000f5feedaba1dafe1ff12956230459ba076e.",
    "The pending migration copies curated immunity set -66 to positive 13282 and adds only Charm mask 2.",
    "Its raw school, dispel, other mechanics, effects, auras and area/chain fields remain unchanged.",
    "Main ignores partial-school immunity on uncontrolled NPCs through Unit::ApplySpellImmune; Charm",
    "remains effective. A separate native Mage 8 at level 47 learns normally obtainable Frostbolt 116",
    "and Fireball 133 to verify positive damage under that policy. The Felsworn learns only its class",
    "control spell. All casts use normal session handlers, native template AI and immunities. Ordinary",
    "charm release uses CMSG_PET_ACTION Abandon. No client-rendering or deployment acceptance is claimed."
  ],
